# Games: one's games on the start screen, a screen for each game, and a screen for each friend to start one.

SCREEN Home ABOUT Alice:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Alice: identity, person
    LIST Games: "Alice plays Game against Bob at Board" OPENS Game
    LIST Friends: PERSONS WITH knows, friend, won, drawn OPENS Person
    Establish: Alice may establish an identity
    Make friends: Acquaint AND Befriend, Bob TYPED
    Start: Alice and Bob may jointly start Game at Board, Bob FROM friend, Game TYPED, THEN IT
    Acquaint: Alice and Bob may jointly come to know each other, Bob TYPED

SCREEN Person ABOUT Bob:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Bob: knows, friend, won, drawn, started
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Carol to Bob, Carol FROM knows
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Bob to Carol, Carol FROM knows
    Befriend: Alice and Bob may jointly become friends
    Unfriend: Alice may end her friendship with Bob
    Start: Alice and Bob may jointly start Game at Board, Game TYPED, THEN IT

SCREEN Game ABOUT "Alice plays Game against Bob at Board":
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW: at, color, made
    Move: Alice may make Move in Game against Bob from Board to Next, Move TYPED
    Win: Alice may claim Game against Bob at Board
    Resign: Alice may resign Game against Bob at Board
    Draw: Alice and Bob may jointly draw Game at Board
